\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Topic over-representation among the 200 highest-scoring documents.} Ratio = share of the topic in the top 200 divided by its share in the sample; observed/expected counts in parentheses; bold = Bonferroni-corrected hypergeometric $p<0.05$ over topics. v1: 48{,}829 documents, uncentred, all positions. v2: 45{,}849 documents, centred, positions $\ge 16$, pre-registered. Only the v2 EM-specific activation projection gives a consistent topic signal; the single significant gradient-alignment topic is one of 12 lists tested.}}{6}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
