\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Continued pretraining on candidate documents shifts the untuned rate but not the post-steering rate.} (a) Loss during 10M tokens of continued pretraining (CPT) of the stage-1 checkpoint on each arm (faint: per step; solid: 10-step mean). Top documents are noisier text: mean loss 2.76, against 2.15 (Random) and 1.65 (Bottom). (b) General misalignment rate before (hollow) and after (filled) training a layer-12 steering vector on bad medical advice; bars are binomial s.e.\ over 400 responses. One CPT seed and one steering seed per arm.}}{8}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cpt}{{5}{8}{\textbf {Continued pretraining on candidate documents shifts the untuned rate but not the post-steering rate.} (a) Loss during 10M tokens of continued pretraining (CPT) of the stage-1 checkpoint on each arm (faint: per step; solid: 10-step mean). Top documents are noisier text: mean loss 2.76, against 2.15 (Random) and 1.65 (Bottom). (b) General misalignment rate before (hollow) and after (filled) training a layer-12 steering vector on bad medical advice; bars are binomial s.e.\ over 400 responses. One CPT seed and one steering seed per arm}{figure.5}{}}
